text = "At the location, where the game is present, a file by the name of [outline_color=2046a8][outline_size=8]settings.ini[/outline_size][/outline_color] is created.

This file can be tweaked by changing values present, altering gameplay experience.

Deleting the file will reset settings to default and similarly doing the same with [outline_color=2046a8][outline_size=8]scores.json[/outline_size][/outline_color] will remove previous scores."
fit_content = true
scroll_active = false
